# ===============================================================================
# FILE PURPOSE:
# Root .gitignore file for the Bhojanalay project repository.
# Specifies untracked files, environment variables, build outputs, and dependencies
# that Git should ignore across both frontend and backend modules.
#
# CONNECTED FILES & FOLDERS:
# - Connected to: backend/.env (Prevents exposing backend secret keys & credentials)
# - Connected to: frontend/.env (Prevents exposing frontend env variables)
# - Connected to: backend/__pycache__/, backend/.pytest_cache/ (Ignores Python caches)
# - Connected to: frontend/node_modules/, frontend/dist/ (Ignores JS dependencies & builds)
# ===============================================================================
frontend/node_modules
frontend/dist
frontend/.env
backend/.env
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
*.db
*.sqlite3
backend/API_ROUTES.md
backend/app/__pycache__/config.cpython-313.pyc
